Assistant Professor in HR and Technology



JOE ID Number: 2026-02\_111478104

Date Posted: 10/07/2026

###### Position Title/Short Description

Title: Assistant Professor in HR and Technology  
Section: US: Full-Time Academic (Permanent, Tenure Track or Tenured)  
